{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01GhSRV1P4SgNCkqgwCv883C", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hands_Across_Hawthorne\"}, {\"url\": \"https://hub.harborframework.com/tasks/openai/2151\"}, {\"url\": \"https://omeka-pilot.manhattan.edu/items/show/499\"}, {\"url\": \"https://omeka-pilot.manhattan.edu/exhibits/show/johnlennonmemorywalk/item/499\"}, {\"url\": \"https://stratfordobserver.co.uk/?p=46514\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/maybe-hold-hands-091600347.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://omeka-pilot.manhattan.edu/items/show/567\"}, {\"url\": \"https://northeasttimes.com/?p=20054\"}, {\"url\": \"https://themorningnews.org/post/you-know-i-believe-and-how\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:23:14.799Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Hands Across Hawthorne 2011 rally crowd sang Beatles song", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_019us4f7t23wMwHMULtfBgoo", "content": [{"title": "Hands Across Hawthorne", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hands_Across_Hawthorne"}, {"title": "hub.harborframework.com", "url": "https://hub.harborframework.com/tasks/openai/2151"}, {"title": "Imagine-John Lennon Memorial-Central Park, NYC 2011", "url": "https://omeka-pilot.manhattan.edu/items/show/499"}, {"title": "Imagine-John Lennon Memorial-Central Park, NYC 2011", "url": "https://omeka-pilot.manhattan.edu/exhibits/show/johnlennonmemorywalk/item/499"}, {"title": "stratfordobserver.co.uk", "url": "https://stratfordobserver.co.uk/?p=46514"}, {"title": "Maybe we need to hold hands", "url": "https://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/maybe-hold-hands-091600347.html"}, {"title": "Fans Celebrating Lennon's Birthday in Strawberry Fields", "url": "https://omeka-pilot.manhattan.edu/items/show/567"}, {"title": "All You Need is Love at St. William Elementary School", "url": "https://northeasttimes.com/?p=20054"}, {"title": "Letters From the Editor", "url": "https://themorningnews.org/post/you-know-i-believe-and-how"}]}, "The search didn't find a source that says which Beatles song the crowd sang at Hands Across Hawthorne, so I can't confirm the answer.\n\n- **The rally itself:** The Wikipedia entry says the rally was held at the Hawthorne Bridge in Portland, Oregon, on May 29, 2011. It was a response to an attack, one week earlier, on Brad Forkner and Christopher Rosevear, a gay male couple who had been holding hands while walking across the bridge. More than 4,000 people attended. The excerpt I received is cut off before any mention of music.\n- **The question source:** A Harbor Framework task page (index 2-2) poses this exact question, but it only restates the question and doesn't give an answer.\n- **Other results:** The remaining hits are about unrelated Beatles or Lennon events, so they don't help here.\n\nTo answer this, the full Wikipedia article or local coverage from Portland outlets (such as The Oregonian) from late May 2011 would be the next place to check."], "durationSeconds": 4.701565583000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01GhSRV1P4SgNCkqgwCv883C", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
