{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01Vxa271HL8TxdjY42X6gRwG", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hands_Across_Hawthorne\"}, {\"url\": \"https://weddingmusicproject.bandcamp.com/track/all-you-need-is-love\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love_Is_All_You_Need_(disambiguation)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_We_Need_Is_Love_(disambiguation)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://seedofpeace.org/all-you-need-is-love/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_We_Need_Is_Love\"}, {\"url\": \"https://rockband.fandom.com/wiki/All_You_Need_Is_Love\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_You_Need_Is_Love_(disambiguation)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.the-paulmccartney-project.com/song/all-you-need-is-love/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_You_Need_Is_Love\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:23:30.753Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Hands Across Hawthorne May 29 2011 crowd sang \"All You Need Is Love\"", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01J3nQPmS9RocMwfvMQgbqcM", "content": [{"title": "Hands Across Hawthorne", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hands_Across_Hawthorne"}, {"title": "All You Need Is Love - Wedding Music Project - Bandcamp", "url": "https://weddingmusicproject.bandcamp.com/track/all-you-need-is-love"}, {"title": "Love Is All You Need (disambiguation)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love_Is_All_You_Need_(disambiguation)"}, {"title": "All We Need Is Love (disambiguation)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_We_Need_Is_Love_(disambiguation)"}, {"title": "All you need is love - Seed of Peace", "url": "https://seedofpeace.org/all-you-need-is-love/"}, {"title": "All We Need Is Love", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_We_Need_Is_Love"}, {"title": "All You Need Is Love", "url": "https://rockband.fandom.com/wiki/All_You_Need_Is_Love"}, {"title": "All You Need Is Love (disambiguation)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_You_Need_Is_Love_(disambiguation)"}, {"title": "All You Need Is Love (song)", "url": "https://www.the-paulmccartney-project.com/song/all-you-need-is-love/"}, {"title": "All You Need Is Love", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_You_Need_Is_Love"}]}, "The search confirms the rally took place but does not show that the crowd sang \"All You Need Is Love.\"\n\n**Hands Across Hawthorne:** Hands Across Hawthorne was a rally held at the Hawthorne Bridge in Portland, Oregon, on May 29, 2011. It was a response to an attack, one week earlier, on Brad Forkner and Christopher Rosevear, a gay male couple who had been holding hands while walking across the bridge. Its aim was linking hands across the entire span of the Hawthorne Bridge to show solidarity. More than 4,000 people attended the rally. The retrieved text was cut off before any description of the event's program, so it doesn't mention a song.\n\n**The song:** The results mostly cover the Beatles' song itself and unrelated songs and films with similar titles. None links the song to the Portland rally. I didn't find any report, video description, or news account of a sing-along there. The lyric pages that came up were not reproduced here.\n\nTo verify the claim, I'd suggest searching Portland news coverage from May 30, 2011 (for example, The Oregonian or Willamette Week) or the Q Center's records of the event."], "durationSeconds": 5.738595208999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01Vxa271HL8TxdjY42X6gRwG", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
