{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_015gK9xKssvourh7m6DWBVxv", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hands_Across_Hawthorne\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Today's_featured_article/May_2017\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.advocate.com/news/daily-news/2011/06/01/portlanders-line-bridge-protest-violence\"}, {\"url\": \"https://newsandletters.org/july-august-2011-queer-notes/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.lgbtqnation.com/2011/05/thousands-hold-hands-at-portland-rally-in-solidarity-with-attacked-gay-couple/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://lists.wikimedia.org/hyperkitty/list/daily-article-l@lists.wikimedia.org/thread/GIY7LD7LBK6VN3FNSDOAM5NZHVU2IWT7/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wikioftheday.com/wotdep.php?pod=featured&epnum=24\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnside_Burn\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.politicsplus.org/blog/2011/05/29/hands-across-the-hawthorne-bridge/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kirk_Reeves\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:23:39.072Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Hawthorne Bridge rally Forkner Rosevear crowd sang Beatles Oregonian 2011", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01U3Wco9uZ99aC1KLTaFd8Rr", "content": [{"title": "Hands Across Hawthorne", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hands_Across_Hawthorne"}, {"title": "Wikipedia:Today's featured article/May 2017", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Today's_featured_article/May_2017"}, {"title": "Portlanders Line Bridge to Protest Violence", "url": "https://www.advocate.com/news/daily-news/2011/06/01/portlanders-line-bridge-protest-violence"}, {"title": "July-August 2011 Queer Notes - News and Letters Committees", "url": "https://newsandletters.org/july-august-2011-queer-notes/"}, {"title": "Thousands hold hands at Portland rally in solidarity with attacked gay couple - LGBTQ Nation", "url": "https://www.lgbtqnation.com/2011/05/thousands-hold-hands-at-portland-rally-in-solidarity-with-attacked-gay-couple/"}, {"title": "May 29: Hands Across Hawthorne - daily-article-l - lists.wikimedia.org", "url": "https://lists.wikimedia.org/hyperkitty/list/daily-article-l@lists.wikimedia.org/thread/GIY7LD7LBK6VN3FNSDOAM5NZHVU2IWT7/"}, {"title": "featured Wiki of the Day Episode 24", "url": "https://wikioftheday.com/wotdep.php?pod=featured&epnum=24"}, {"title": "Burnside Burn", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnside_Burn"}, {"title": "Hands Across the Hawthorne Bridge", "url": "https://www.politicsplus.org/blog/2011/05/29/hands-across-the-hawthorne-bridge/"}, {"title": "Kirk Reeves", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kirk_Reeves"}]}, "The search didn't turn up anything about the crowd singing Beatles songs, and I didn't find the Oregonian's 2011 coverage itself. The results do cover the event, which was called Hands Across Hawthorne.\n\n- **The event:** A rally was held at the Hawthorne Bridge in Portland, Oregon, on May 29, 2011. Its purpose was to link hands across the bridge's full span in solidarity with the couple. Several LGBTQ and human rights organizations sponsored it in response to the attack.\n- **The attack:** Brad Forkner and Christopher Rosevear were assaulted on the bridge about a week earlier. Three men who had apparently followed them attacked them from behind and began beating them. The two sustained minor injuries.\n- **Crowd size:** Estimates were about 4,000. They gathered in the rain to hold hands on the bridge. Afterward, the crowd walked down both sides of the bridge holding hands.\n- **Speakers:** Forkner, Rosevear, Mayor Adams, and other community leaders spoke at the rally.\n\nFor the singing detail, you'd need the Oregonian's own May 2011 article or a local outlet such as Just Out, which the Advocate cited for crowd coverage. A search of the Oregonian archive for \"Hands Across Hawthorne\" would be the next step."], "durationSeconds": 6.316844124999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_015gK9xKssvourh7m6DWBVxv", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
