{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_011Wgk46gWyUJ1PahjwDw4vD", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hands_Across_Hawthorne\"}, {\"url\": \"https://katu.com/archive/thousands-rally-at-hands-across-hawthorne-11-19-2015\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qco3lVQq17I\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/Hands_Across_Hawthorne\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.beinbean.com/2011/06/terry-bean-hands-across-hawthorne-a-success-in-portland/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wikioftheday.com/wotdep.php?pod=featured&epnum=24\"}, {\"url\": \"https://archive.qpdx.com/tag/hands-across-hawthorne/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnside_Burn\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Protests_in_Portland,_Oregon\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:23:48.394Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"Hands Across Hawthorne\" Basic Rights Oregon volunteers crowd sang Beatles", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01U3xAgwXiaEewjtBSCcubsk", "content": [{"title": "Hands Across Hawthorne", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hands_Across_Hawthorne"}, {"title": "Thousands rally at Hands Across Hawthorne", "url": "https://katu.com/archive/thousands-rally-at-hands-across-hawthorne-11-19-2015"}, {"title": "Hands Across Hawthorne - YouTube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qco3lVQq17I"}, {"title": "Hands Across Hawthorne - Wikiwand", "url": "https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/Hands_Across_Hawthorne"}, {"title": "Terry Bean - Hands Across Hawthorne, A Success in Portland - Bein' Bean", "url": "https://www.beinbean.com/2011/06/terry-bean-hands-across-hawthorne-a-success-in-portland/"}, {"title": "featured Wiki of the Day Episode 24", "url": "https://wikioftheday.com/wotdep.php?pod=featured&epnum=24"}, {"title": "Hands Across Hawthorne", "url": "https://archive.qpdx.com/tag/hands-across-hawthorne/"}, {"title": "Burnside Burn", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnside_Burn"}, {"title": "Protests in Portland, Oregon", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Protests_in_Portland,_Oregon"}]}, "The search confirms the basic event but does not support the \"crowd sang\" detail.\n\n- **Event:** The rally took place on May 29, 2011, on Portland's Hawthorne Bridge, sponsored by several LGBTQ and human rights organizations to show solidarity after an attack on a gay couple holding hands.\n- **Basic Rights Oregon:** It was one of the supporters. A KATU report says the event was supported by the Q-Center, Basic Rights Oregon, local churches and others. A Wikiwand excerpt also mentions that Basic Rights Oregon executive director Jeana Frazzini thanked the couple and spoke of the symbolism of the hand-holding rally.\n- **Volunteers:** The Q Center volunteers are documented for a different action. They formed street patrols to monitor Portland's downtown area after the attack. I found no source saying they led the singing.\n- **Beatles:** Only one source, a personal blog (Bein' Bean), mentions music. It says residents showed up to walk across the bridge while the Beatles song \"I Want to Hold Your Hand\" was played. That describes playback, not the crowd singing, and I found no other source confirming it.\n- **Turnout:** Estimates vary. KATU said about 2,000 were expected, while Wikipedia and a Q Center–related archive put attendance at more than 4,000."], "durationSeconds": 6.077688625000002, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_011Wgk46gWyUJ1PahjwDw4vD", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
