{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDUyJMssAK4ZQg5dZtVh", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：很可能是《I Want to Hold Your Hand》，但我没能完全证实。** 5 次搜索已经用完。\n\n找到的依据：\n\n- 唯一提到披头士的是 Terry Bean 的个人博客。它说市民走过桥时在放《I Want to Hold Your Hand》。但它写的是\"放这首歌\"，不是\"大家一起唱\"，而且没有别的来源能印证。\n- 维基百科和 KATU 的报道都证实了：集会在 2011 年 5 月 29 日，地点是 Hawthorne Bridge，Basic Rights Oregon 是主办方之一，Forkner 上台讲了话。但我拿到的摘要都在讲到唱歌之前就断了，所以题目里\"Forkner 讲话、招募 Queer Patrol 志愿者之后大家唱歌\"这个顺序没有核实到。\n\n另外，我也试搜了《All You Need Is Love》，没有任何结果把这首歌和这次集会联系起来。要确认的话，可以直接去看维基百科条目全文里描述集会过程的那一段。\n\nSources:\n- [Terry Bean - Hands Across Hawthorne, A Success in Portland - Bein' Bean](https://www.beinbean.com/2011/06/terry-bean-hands-across-hawthorne-a-success-in-portland/)\n- [Hands Across Hawthorne - Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hands_Across_Hawthorne)\n- [Thousands rally at Hands Across Hawthorne - KATU](https://katu.com/archive/thousands-rally-at-hands-across-hawthorne-11-19-2015)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1366, "cache_read_input_tokens": 9011, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1366}, "output_tokens": 4, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:23:56.929Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDUyJ3mm6Qgfjzu3MAuL"}
